<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - British Telecom cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - British Telecom cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs lowered its recommendation on British Telecommunications Plc to market perform from a trading buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- NYSE-traded shares slipped 1/8 to 63 in midsession trade.</p>
</text>
